{"id":"vod_sn_38482","vodId":"38482","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"赌博默示录：破戒录篇","name_cn":"赌博默示录：破戒录篇","date":"2011-01-01","year":"2011","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/ea95c550175f95b9c2f6ca3eb67f1b1d.jpg"},"summary":"在与帝爱组会长兵藤和尊（津嘉山正種 配音）的对决中，伊藤开司（萩原聖人 配音）马失前蹄，欠下对方高达一千万日元的债务。由于无力偿还，开司被帝爱组投入地下的设施内进行强制劳动。在接下来的15年里，他将毫无希望地在这所人间地狱内工作直到还清所有帐务。而逃出这里的唯一希望就是那张“1日外出券”。地狱有地狱的法则，外出券需要付出相当大数额的代笔来获取。为了那一线希望，开司再次投入赌局之中。相比地上世界的赌坊，这里充满了更多的欲望、贪婪、诱惑以及罪恶。对开司来说，这无疑是一次刀尖上的舞蹈……　　本片根据日本漫画家福本伸行的原著改编。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:01:56","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/7MwJD0MgHR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uLbj2Jq1XP1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Tvg9Bf4dN81/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/qewsifNNit1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/QGvvcB4FKc1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/bp9R107e6L1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UirzbW8EH61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/xiW28uaUuq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/fUmAip2MmJ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/jUqDSE6fVe1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/sLDz3JWDiu1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8ppGUwX9ga1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/RZDq1mmVFX1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Xckkc2Qcre1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"http